{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119246","id":3628590459,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7YR-V7","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119246","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119246.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119246.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119246","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119246/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119246/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119246/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/a6d1c69fc96a79c6d99c953a7ef4a50f6e2dbcd4","number":119246,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix update blend point name","user":{"login":"xuhuisheng","id":1118508,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTg1MDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1118508?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng","html_url":"https://github.com/xuhuisheng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119164\r\n\r\n## Issue Description\r\n\r\nWhen we update `animation` from `Inspector`, the `AnimationNodeAnimation` didn't trigger `_animation_node_renamed` signal, and `AnimationNodeBlendSpace1D` didn't handle `_animation_node_renamed` signal, too.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nWe can consider whether the `animation` of `AnimationNodeAnimation` changed, and trigger `_animation_node_renamed` signal.\r\n\r\nThen we need update `name` of `blend_point` in `_animation_node_renamed()`.\r\n\r\nThe name of blend_point can be updated successful.\r\n\r\n[blend-point-name.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0e5d520e-d8e3-462d-b925-feae2ef2b78c)\r\n\r\n\r\n## Etc\r\n\r\nBut, I cannot find how to trigger `redraw` for `AnimationNodeBlendSpace1DEditor`. So the label of `blend_point` cannot update immediately. We should switch tab to see the final result of label.\r\n\r\nIs there any advice for `redraw`?","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-05-05T05:59:16Z","updated_at":"2026-05-14T13:48:28Z","closed_at":"2026-05-14T13:43:03Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"441183be3c309f48e86c138be9253162b1d32e34","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"xuhuisheng:dev/blend-point-name","ref":"dev/blend-point-name","rep